# -*- mode:org; coding:utf-8 -*-
#+TITLE: cadgui-3-2d-parity — full 2D user compatibility
#+STATUS: DEFERRED
#+PRIORITY: P3
#+TYPE: feature
#+DEPENDS: cadgui-2-qt6-gui-host
#+TARGET: release 3.0
#+BRANCH: qt6-gui
#+DATE: 2026-11-16
#+PARENT: cadgui-release-3.0-epic

* Context

Phase 3 of [[cadgui-release-3.0-epic]]. Phase 2 delivers the minimal interactive
canvas; this phase brings the 2D user experience to AutoCAD/BricsCAD parity. The
breadth phase: mostly throughput-bound, with a few depth poles (dimensioning,
dynamic blocks, DWG round-trip). To be sliced in detail when it becomes active;
this issue scopes the deliverables, dependencies and acceptance themes.

* Deliverables (each a slice: implement + headless/offscreen test + doc)

- *Interactive built-in commands*: wire =%cmd-*= to PARK on canvas input (cador
  D1 §13.5) so the built-in draw/modify commands read live points -- click-to-draw.
- *Grips* (hot-grip edit), *osnap* (object snaps) + *object-snap tracking*,
  *polar/ortho*, *dynamic input*.
- *Selection*: all modes (window/crossing/fence/wpolygon/previous/last/all), grip
  and quick-select.
- *Fidelity*: text (SHX + TTF glyphs), hatch fill, linetypes + lineweights,
  TrueColor, the associative *dimensioning* engine, tables, fields, multileaders.
- *Dynamic blocks* + the block editor; *xrefs*; parametric *constraints* + solver.
- *Layouts + plotting* (paper space, viewports, PDF plot).
- *Palettes / app shell*: layers, properties, the ribbon/menus (as Action-Layer
  surfaces), command aliases (PGP).
- *DWG 2D round-trip*: open + save real-world 2D drawings faithfully (libredwg
  read + the R2018-write fork).

* Dependencies / sequencing

After [[cadgui-2-qt6-gui-host]] (the canvas + input + regen) and on
[[cadgui-action-layer]] (every new command/palette registers through it). The
dimensioning engine and dynamic blocks are the depth poles; DWG round-trip
validation sets the real calendar, not the command count.

* Test & doc approach

- Each command/interaction: an Action-Layer headless test (the guard requires it)
  + an offscreen golden image where rendering matters.
- DWG round-trip: a corpus of fixture drawings, assert re-read equality.
- Doc: grow =clautolisp-cadgui-spec.org= + the user-manual per command family.

* Acceptance themes

- [ ] Click-to-draw with the built-in commands (grips/osnap/tracking/dynamic
      input) at a human's fidelity.
- [ ] Text, hatch, linetypes/lineweights, associative dimensions, dynamic blocks,
      xrefs, constraints render and edit correctly.
- [ ] Layouts + PDF plot.
- [ ] A corpus of real 2D DWGs opens, edits and saves with faithful round-trip.
- [ ] Every new interaction registered + headless-tested through the Action Layer.
